[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2015\u2015\u3068\u3044\u3046\u308F\u3051\u3067\u3001\u304A\u6301\u3061\u3057\u305F\u8A66\u4F5C\u54C1\u3067\u3059\u304C\u3001\n\u3044\u304B\u304C\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u304B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...So, what do you think of the prototype I\u0027ve brought?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30AF\u30E9\u30A6\u30C7\u30A3\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304A\u304A\u2026\u2026\u304A\u304A\u304A\u304A\uFF01\n\u3059\u3001\u3059\u3054\u3044\u305E\u3001\u3053\u308C\u306F\u3041\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh... OH WOW!\nTh-this is incredible!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u5546\u4EBAA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Merchant A"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u98DF\u3079\u305F\u3060\u3051\u3067\u3001\u8EAB\u4F53\u306E\u82AF\u304B\u3089\u6E29\u304B\u304F\u306A\u3063\u3066\u2026\u2026\n\u3053\u308C\u306A\u3089\u6975\u5BD2\u306E\u96EA\u5C71\u3082\u7C21\u5358\u306B\u8E0F\u7834\u3067\u304D\u305D\u3046\u3060\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Just eating it warms you up from the inside...\nWith this, traversing snowy mountains would be a breeze!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u5546\u4EBAB",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Merchant B"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3053\u308C\u3092\u30EA\u30F3\u30C7\u796D\u524D\u65E5\u306B\u7D0D\u54C1\u3057\u3066\u3044\u305F\u3060\u3051\u308B\u3093\u3067\u3059\u306D\uFF01\n\u3042\u308A\u304C\u3068\u3046\u3054\u3056\u3044\u307E\u3059\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And you\u0027ll be able to deliver these the day before the Linde Festival!\nThank you so much!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u5546\u4EBAC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Merchant C"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304A\u6C17\u306B\u53EC\u3057\u305F\u3088\u3046\u3067\u4F55\u3088\u308A\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027m glad it meets your expectations."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30AF\u30E9\u30A6\u30C7\u30A3\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3044\u3084\u3041\u3001\u3053\u308C\u304C\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u304B\u3041\u2026\u2026\n\u306A\u308B\u307B\u3069\u306A\u308B\u307B\u3069\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So this is alchemy, huh...\nFascinating, fascinating..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u5546\u4EBAA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Merchant A"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u30AF\u30E9\u30A6\u30C7\u30A3\u30A2\u3055\u3093\u3001\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6\u3055\u3093\uFF01\n\u6298\u308A\u5165\u3063\u3066\u3001\u304A\u9858\u3044\u304C\u3042\u308A\u307E\u3059\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Miss Klaudia, Miss Ryza!\nI have another important request!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u5546\u4EBAC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Merchant C"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306F\u3001\u306F\u3041\u2026\u2026\u306A\u3093\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh... yes? What is it?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30AF\u30E9\u30A6\u30C7\u30A3\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3082\u3046\uFF11\u3064\u3001\u30EA\u30F3\u30C7\u796D\u306B\u5411\u3051\u3066\n\u65B0\u5546\u54C1\u3092\u958B\u767A\u3057\u3066\u306F\u3044\u305F\u3060\u3051\u306A\u3044\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u304B\u3063\uFF01\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Would you be willing to develop one more new product\nfor the Linde Festival!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u5546\u4EBAC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Merchant C"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u3078\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Huh?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u307E\u3001\u307E\u3055\u304B\u306E\u304A\u304B\u308F\u308A\u304C\u304F\u308B\u3068\u306F\u2026\u2026\n\u3057\u304B\u3082\u3001\u4ECA\u5EA6\u306F\u98DF\u3079\u3082\u306E\u4EE5\u5916\u3067\u3063\u3066\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I wasn\u0027t expecting a second request...\nAnd this time, something other than food..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u79C1\u304C\u8A00\u3046\u306E\u3082\u306A\u3093\u3060\u3051\u3069\u2026\u2026\n\u65AD\u3063\u3066\u3082\u3088\u304B\u3063\u305F\u3093\u3060\u3088\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I know it\u0027s a bit strange for me to say this, but...\nYou could have declined, you know?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30AF\u30E9\u30A6\u30C7\u30A3\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3046\uFF5E\u3093\u3001\u305D\u3046\u306A\u3093\u3060\u3051\u3069\u3055\u3002\u3042\u3093\u306A\u30AD\u30E9\u30AD\u30E9\u3057\u305F\u76EE\u3067\n\u304A\u9858\u3044\u3055\u308C\u3061\u3083\u3046\u3068\u306D\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mmm, I know, but... When they look at you with those\nsparkly eyes, it\u0027s hard to say no..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u306F\u306F\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ahaha..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30AF\u30E9\u30A6\u30C7\u30A3\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3084\u3042\u3001\u4E8C\u4EBA\u3068\u3082\u3002\n\u4F55\u3084\u3089\u60A9\u3093\u3067\u3044\u308B\u307F\u305F\u3044\u3060\u304C\u3001\u3069\u3046\u304B\u3057\u305F\u306E\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey, you two.\nYou seem troubled. Is something wrong?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3001\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, Logy."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5B9F\u306F\u2015\u2015",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, actually\u2014"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30AF\u30E9\u30A6\u30C7\u30A3\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u3044\u3046\u7D4C\u7DEF\u304C\u3042\u3063\u305F\u3093\u3060\u306A\u3002\n\u3053\u308C\u307E\u305F\u3001\u767A\u60F3\u529B\u304C\u8A66\u3055\u308C\u305D\u3046\u306A\u96E3\u984C\u3060",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see, so that\u0027s what happened.\nSounds like quite the challenging request."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u306A\u3093\u3060\u3088\u306D\u3002\n\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC\u3060\u3063\u305F\u3089\u3069\u3046\u3059\u308B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah, exactly.\nWhat would you do in this situation, Logy?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4FFA\u306A\u3089\uFF1F\n\u305D\u3046\u3060\u306A\u3041\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Me?\nWell, let\u0027s see..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4FFA\u3060\u3063\u305F\u3089\u643A\u5E2F\u3067\u304D\u308B\u71B1\u6E90\u2015\u2015\n\u30AB\u30A4\u30ED\u3092\u4F5C\u308B\u304C\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027d probably make a portable heat source\u2014\nlike a hand warmer..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30EA\u30F3\u30C7\u796D\u306E\u96F0\u56F2\u6C17\u3092\u8E0F\u307E\u3048\u308B\u3068\u3001\n\u5C11\u3057\u8272\u6C17\u306E\u8DB3\u308A\u306A\u3044\u767A\u60F3\u304B\u3082\u3057\u308C\u306A\u3044\u306A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Though considering the festive atmosphere of the Linde Festival,\nthat might be a bit too practical."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u307E\u3001\u3068\u306B\u304B\u304F\u3060\u3002\n\u5C11\u3057\u306F\u53C2\u8003\u306B\u306A\u308C\u3070\u3044\u3044\u3093\u3060\u304C",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, anyway.\nI hope that helps somehow."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3046\u3046\u3093\u3001\u5341\u5206\u3060\u3088\uFF01\n\u3042\u308A\u304C\u3068\u306D\u3001\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No, that\u0027s plenty helpful!\nThanks, Logy!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u306B\u3057\u3066\u3082\u3001\u643A\u5E2F\u3067\u304D\u308B\u71B1\u6E90\u304B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Still though, a portable heat source..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u3092\u30EA\u30F3\u30C7\u796D\u306E\u8D08\u308A\u3082\u306E\u98A8\u306B\u3059\u308B\u306A\u3089\u3001\n\u3082\u3063\u3068\u88C5\u98FE\u54C1\u3063\u307D\u304F\u3059\u308B\u3068\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If we want to make it more gift-like for the Linde Festival,\nmaybe we could make it more decorative?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30AF\u30E9\u30A6\u30C7\u30A3\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u304B\u2015\u2015",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Or maybe\u2014"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u8863\u670D\u81EA\u4F53\u304C\u767A\u71B1\u3057\u305F\u308A\u3001\u3068\u304B\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We could make clothes that generate heat themselves!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]